{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"snezhnaya_overview","name_zh":"至冬","name_en":"Snezhnaya","aliases":["至冬","Snezhnaya"],"category":"nation","scope":"regional","regions":["Snezhnaya"],"summary":"至冬是提瓦特七国之一，供奉现任冰之女皇。其国土以持久风雪、严寒环境及发达的工业技术著称，最南端包含自治地区挪德卡莱；首都是至冬堡，女皇自至冬宫统治。愚人众是受女皇控制、从至冬宫派出的军事与外交力量，但其是否等同于至冬政府，以及至冬现行政府的完整结构，现有证据仍未明确。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"snezhnaya_overview_fact_001","text":"至冬是提瓦特七国之一，也是主要地区之一，国民供奉冰之女皇这位冰之神。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_snezhnaya_overview","fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_01"]},{"fact_id":"snezhnaya_overview_fact_002","text":"据蒙德方面的治理者所述，至冬与蒙德地位相同，是不隶属于其他国家的独立国家。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_snezhnaya_overview","fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_01"]},{"fact_id":"snezhnaya_overview_fact_003","text":"挪德卡莱位于至冬最南端，是至冬境内的自治地区。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_snezhnaya_overview","fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_01","bwiki_snezhnaya_overview"]},{"fact_id":"snezhnaya_overview_fact_004","text":"至冬常年受到冬季风暴影响，夜空可见极光。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期自然环境","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_snezhnaya_overview","fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_01"]},{"fact_id":"snezhnaya_overview_fact_005","text":"至冬当地人的说法称，暴风雪可能连续持续一个月；另有至冬人声称，在户外若不持续活动便可能冻死。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"通常气候条件下","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_snezhnaya_overview","fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_01"]},{"fact_id":"snezhnaya_overview_fact_006","text":"至冬相关工业技术包括大型工厂、机械战斗服、枪炮及自动化研究设施；至冬制造的部分武器被明确描述为采用先进技术。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前及近现代","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_snezhnaya_overview","fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_01"]},{"fact_id":"snezhnaya_overview_fact_007","text":"至冬堡（Snezhnograd）是至冬首都；至冬宫（Zapolyarny Palace）位于其中，是冰之女皇的居所及其统治至冬的施政地点。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_snezhnaya_overview","fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_01","fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_04","bwiki_snezhnaya_overview"]},{"fact_id":"snezhnaya_overview_fact_008","text":"现任冰之女皇是至冬的统治者；她在约五百年前的灾变中，于前任冰之神死亡后继位。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"约五百年前至今","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_03"]},{"fact_id":"snezhnaya_overview_fact_009","text":"冰之女皇继位后的改革削弱并废除了旧妖精封建贵族的政治权力，设立皇都评议会（Snezhnograd Veche）作为行政机关，并任命人类担任初任议长。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"冰之女皇在位初期","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_03","bwiki_snezhnaya_overview"]},{"fact_id":"snezhnaya_overview_fact_010","text":"愚人众是受冰之女皇控制的军事力量，同时以来自至冬宫的外交代表团身份在其他国家活动；其成员还承担官僚、政治与商业等多种职能。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_snezhnaya_overview","fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_01","fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_02","fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_04","local_sup_snezhnaya_overview_04"]},{"fact_id":"snezhnaya_overview_fact_011","text":"冰之女皇对愚人众及执行官具有命令和任命权；她赐予执行官名号，且直接游戏文本记载她曾同意召回一名执行官并命令其返回至冬。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"冰之女皇在位期间","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_03","local_sup_snezhnaya_overview_01","local_sup_snezhnaya_overview_04"]},{"fact_id":"snezhnaya_overview_fact_012","text":"据执行官所述，女皇设有禁止执行官彼此兵刃相向的纪律约束。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_snezhnaya_overview_02"]},{"fact_id":"snezhnaya_overview_fact_013","text":"在其他国家的公开认知中，愚人众常被视为代表女皇、负责至冬对外事务的政治部门。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_02"]},{"fact_id":"snezhnaya_overview_fact_014","text":"至冬现行政府的完整结构及愚人众的正式法定地位尚未被完整界定；现有证据不能确认愚人众本身就是至冬的全部治理机构，还是仅为其中一部分。","status":"unknown","temporal_scope":"当前","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_snezhnaya_overview","fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_01","fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_02"]}],"timeline":[{"period":"约五百年前：坎瑞亚灾变及王位更替","order_hint":1,"events":["前任冰之神在灾变期间死亡，安娜丝塔夏·费奥多罗夫娜·雪奈茨娜娅继任冰之神并成为至冬女皇。"],"current_status":"冰之女皇至今仍是至冬的统治者。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_03","bwiki_snezhnaya_overview"]},{"period":"冰之女皇在位第二至第三年","order_hint":2,"events":["贝洛沃迪港的人类在继承危机中宣布自治，引发反叛。","次年，女皇在皮耶罗领导下建立愚人众，并命其夺回港口、压制反叛及收回部分妖精贵族的权力。"],"current_status":"愚人众由此成为女皇直接运用的重要军事与政治力量。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_03","bwiki_snezhnaya_overview"]},{"period":"冰之女皇在位第三至第七年","order_hint":3,"events":["女皇要求未觐见的妖精王公交出权力，并在至冬堡附近建立愚人众城塞格鲁波夫。","女皇以皇都评议会取代旧妖精贵族的行政地位，并由人类担任初任议长。","在位第七年颁布的改革诏书进一步终结了妖精贵族作为至冬统治阶层的旧秩序。"],"current_status":"旧妖精封建统治已被新秩序取代，但当前全部行政机关及其权责关系仍未完整公开。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_03","bwiki_snezhnaya_overview","fandom_snezhnaya_overview"]},{"period":"后续数百年至今","order_hint":4,"events":["冰之女皇持续从提瓦特各地招揽强者，并将其任命为愚人众执行官。","当前文本仍显示女皇能够召回执行官、撤回支持并以纪律约束执行官。"],"current_status":"女皇对愚人众及执行官保持最高权威；愚人众是否在法律上等同至冬政府仍属未知。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_03","local_sup_snezhnaya_overview_01","local_sup_snezhnaya_overview_02","local_sup_snezhnaya_overview_03","local_sup_snezhnaya_overview_04","fandom_snezhnaya_overview"]}],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"提瓦特公众通常可能知道至冬是供奉冰之女皇的北方独立国家，以严寒、工业技术及强大的愚人众闻名；至冬内部的完整政府结构通常不属于公开且明确的信息。","likely_known_by":["至冬居民","愚人众成员","愚人众执行官与至冬宫相关人员","与至冬往来的外国政府、外交人员、商人及旅行者","研究至冬历史与政治的学者"],"unlikely_known_by":["未与至冬接触的普通外国居民","普通愚人众基层成员对女皇最终计划的完整了解者","能够准确说明至冬全部行政机关及其法定权责的普通公众"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":["因愚人众兼具强大军事、外交和政治影响力，外界容易将其直接等同于至冬的全部政府；现有证据并未确认这种等同关系。","愚人众成员普遍忠于女皇和至冬，但这不意味着基层成员普遍知晓女皇的最终计划。"]},"activation_keys":["至冬","Snezhnaya"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["魔神任务章节的游玩归属及地区可访问状态","角色可玩性、稀有度、元素、武器与模型分类","版本发布日期、兑换码及更新历史","敌人战斗表现、玩家操作、奖励与攻略信息"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["将愚人众直接认定为至冬全部政府或唯一法定治理机构","在缺乏直接界定的情况下补全至冬现行政府的完整层级和机关权责","仅凭愚人众的军事与外交影响力推断其法定统治地位","将预告页、文化原型、词源推测或发布日期推测写成世界内事实","将角色对女皇情感、动机或权能的个人评价改写为无条件客观事实"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_snezhnaya_overview","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Snezhnaya","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Snezhnaya","language":"en","revision_id":"2136758","source_text_sha256":"71ccab67a35cd49acd081e73cf91326df347450dbb247c74436dfcb79e767c31"},{"source_id":"bwiki_snezhnaya_overview","provider":"bwiki","role":"cross_language_verification","title":"至冬","url":"https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/%E8%87%B3%E5%86%AC","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"674028","source_text_sha256":"5c3d01196557ec5b3654739563e8c38010bd8ef792399707825a028abab9274f"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_01","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Snezhnaya","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Snezhnaya","language":"en","revision_id":"2136758","source_text_sha256":"77952faa13a348f92ad6b4fba9eb905d4b7b1feffb221b98efc2d1cee3715c8e"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_02","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Fatui","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Fatui","language":"en","revision_id":"2134474","source_text_sha256":"84b462e5c7a71b6cdc811432cf6d1ec19ba129f9edf8e764143eb4444159dad3"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_03","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Tsaritsa","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Tsaritsa","language":"en","revision_id":"2136571","source_text_sha256":"d3e1d58bfe53f29c7e9daa72779cac9543f48f6c3e08142b2908de24d1a0682f"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_snezhnaya_overview_04","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Zapolyarny Palace","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Zapolyarny_Palace","language":"en","revision_id":"2115144","source_text_sha256":"d65c992cdf76465b772ff886938d1c68d1dce30130e627eed71d53220ce6d086"},{"source_id":"local_sup_snezhnaya_overview_01","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"无法传达的涟漪","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_6026.json#unit=602610","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"b49ca740e3ef817926916e045e81667dee6e1d8552818d76702c6804777c502d"},{"source_id":"local_sup_snezhnaya_overview_02","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"回到月亮上去","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_6028.json#unit=602804","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"aac5b90055b84e17b3e59d2f23fad7300032c170e1bbf839ad929bf25412962f"},{"source_id":"local_sup_snezhnaya_overview_03","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"你我交错的时空","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_6022.json#unit=602211","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"2880cf8b0659a1b95a1ab8840352ce8f6a4f2977ce16f5a35e496773a8c84f45"},{"source_id":"local_sup_snezhnaya_overview_04","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"来自冬天的故事","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_20600.json#unit=2060006","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"2e206ab3b5385f08fe0c669e880092046928008ac900b2959b2034bf2925a81d"}],"evidence_bundle_sha256":"ddc7cd9d28161030ecd1b5bddc4de7c39af0110f4ed8c716d41f193debb01989","review":{"cross_language_conflicts":[],"uncertain_claims":["至冬的独立地位来自角色陈述，故保留为 reported。","暴风雪可持续一个月及户外必须不断活动的具体严寒程度来自角色陈述，故保留为 reported。","执行官之间不得兵刃相向的纪律由执行官在特定情境中提及，缺少独立制度文本，故保留为 reported。","皇都评议会的现行权限、与其他机关的关系及制度延续细节未被完整说明。"],"missing_evidence":["缺少主来源对至冬现行政府完整架构、各治理机关权责，以及愚人众正式法定地位的直接界定。"],"needs_human_review":true}}